          "_name": "slider05",
          "_sourceTheme": "flexm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"german-guide-section\" id=\"german-integration-guide\">\n    <div class=\"guide-container container\">\n        \n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"guide-header\">\n            <span class=\"header-tag\">OFFICIAL GUIDE</span>\n            <h1 class=\"header-title mbr-fonts-style display-2\"><strong>Learning German: Social Integration</strong></h1>\n            <p class=\"header-lead mbr-fonts-style display-7\">\n                Levels, Certificates, Exams, and Registration — The Complete Guide.\n            </p>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Why do you need a certificate -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M3 21h18\"></path><path d=\"M5 21V7l7-4 7 4v14\"></path><path d=\"M9 10h6\"></path><path d=\"M9 14h6\"></path><path d=\"M9 18h6\"></path></svg>\n                </span>\n                Why Do You Need a Certificate?\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"intro-text\">In Germany, simply stating \"I speak German\" is not an argument an authority accepts. In many cases, official proof in the form of a certificate from a recognized institution is mandatory. You will need it primarily for:</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"benefits-grid mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                    <h4>Permanent Residence (Niederlassungserlaubnis)</h4>\n                    <p>In most cases, proof of German at the B1 level is required, alongside a \"Leben in Deutschland\" exam or orientation course.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                    <h4>German Citizenship (Einbürgerung)</h4>\n                    <p>Applicants under Section 10 of the Citizenship Act must prove B1 level German. Note: The citizenship test checks knowledge, not language skills.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                    <h4>Work and Studies</h4>\n                    <p>Many employers, vocational schools, and universities require a certificate. Recognizing qualifications acquired in Ukraine often requires a specific language level.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"benefit-card\">\n                    <h4>Integration Course Completion</h4>\n                    <p>The certificate is the official document proving you have successfully completed the course.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- The Six Levels -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"18\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"18\" y2=\"10\"></line><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"4\"></line><line x1=\"6\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"6\" y2=\"14\"></line><line x1=\"2\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"22\" y2=\"20\"></line></svg>\n                </span>\n                The Six Levels (CEFR)\n            </h2>\n            <p class=\"intro-text\">All certificates in Germany are based on a uniform European six-level scale. The critical level is <strong>B1</strong> — the threshold for almost all significant rights (permanent residence, citizenship, professional recognition).</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"levels-grid mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"level-card\">\n                    <div class=\"level-badge\">A1</div>\n                    <h4 class=\"level-name\">Beginner</h4>\n                    <p>Basic phrases, introducing yourself, asking and answering very simple questions.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"level-card\">\n                    <div class=\"level-badge\">A2</div>\n                    <h4 class=\"level-name\">Basic</h4>\n                    <p>Understanding common everyday expressions, handling simple routines, understanding short texts like signs or ads.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"level-card highlight-level\">\n                    <div class=\"level-badge target-badge\">B1</div>\n                    <h4 class=\"level-name\">Independent (Target Level)</h4>\n                    <p>Understanding main points regarding work and leisure, handling most everyday situations, describing experiences.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"level-card\">\n                    <div class=\"level-badge\">B2</div>\n                    <h4 class=\"level-name\">Upper Independent</h4>\n                    <p>Conducting professional conversations, understanding complex texts, working in most standard workplaces.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"level-card\">\n                    <div class=\"level-badge\">C1</div>\n                    <h4 class=\"level-name\">Proficient</h4>\n                    <p>Academic studies, senior professional roles, fluent and flexible language use.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"level-card\">\n                    <div class=\"level-badge\">C2</div>\n                    <h4 class=\"level-name\">Mastery</h4>\n                    <p>Level close to a native speaker.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Which Certificate -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M14 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V8z\"></path><polyline points=\"14 2 14 8 20 8\"></polyline><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"13\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"13\"></line><line x1=\"16\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"8\" y2=\"17\"></line><polyline points=\"10 9 9 9 8 9\"></polyline></svg>\n                </span>\n                Which Certificate is Right for You?\n            </h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"cert-grid mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"cert-card\">\n                    <h3 class=\"cert-title\">1. DTZ (Deutsch-Test für Zuwanderer)</h3>\n                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Integration course participants.</p>\n                    <p>The standard integration course final exam. It provides a safety net: results range between A2 and B1. Even if you don't reach B1 in all areas, you may still walk away with an A2 certificate.</p>\n                    <div class=\"cert-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Cost:</strong> Free for course participants (usually 100-170 EUR otherwise)</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"cert-card\">\n                    <h3 class=\"cert-title\">2. telc Deutsch</h3>\n                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Independent learners needing a recognized B1.</p>\n                    <p>Open to everyone without requiring an integration course. Offers more exam dates and locations. <em>telc C1 Hochschule</em> is accepted by almost all German universities.</p>\n                    <div class=\"cert-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Cost:</strong> ~120-250 EUR depending on level and center</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"cert-card\">\n                    <h3 class=\"cert-title\">3. Goethe-Zertifikat</h3>\n                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> International recognition and flexibility.</p>\n                    <p>The most globally recognized certificate. Modular structure allows you to take and retake individual skills separately (Reading, Listening, Writing, Speaking).</p>\n                    <div class=\"cert-meta\">\n                        <span><strong>Cost:</strong> Varies by module/level</span>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"cert-card\">\n                    <h3 class=\"cert-title\">4. ÖSD</h3>\n                    <p><strong>Best for:</strong> Valid alternative.</p>\n                    <p>An Austrian certificate that is fully recognized in Germany, including for citizenship at the B1 level. Less common in certain regions but completely valid.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Step by step -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M9 11l3 3L22 4\"></path><path d=\"M21 12v7a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h11\"></path></svg>\n                </span>\n                Registration: Step-by-Step\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"steps-container mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"step-item\">\n                    <div class=\"step-number\">1</div>\n                    <div class=\"step-content\">\n                        <h4>Decide on the certificate</h4>\n                        <p>If in an integration course, you will take the DTZ. Otherwise, choose telc or Goethe.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"step-item\">\n                    <div class=\"step-number\">2</div>\n                    <div class=\"step-content\">\n                        <h4>Find a test center</h4>\n                        <p>Start with the local VHS (Volkshochschule). It is usually the most accessible and affordable option.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"step-item\">\n                    <div class=\"step-number\">3</div>\n                    <div class=\"step-content\">\n                        <h4>Register early</h4>\n                        <p>DTZ registration closes at least 4 weeks prior. Goethe exams close 3-4 weeks ahead. No cancellations are allowed after the deadline.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"step-item\">\n                    <div class=\"step-number\">4</div>\n                    <div class=\"step-content\">\n                        <h4>Prepare documents</h4>\n                        <p>ID or Passport. For DTZ, bring your eligibility/obligation document from BAMF, Jobcenter, or Immigration Office.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"step-item\">\n                    <div class=\"step-number\">5</div>\n                    <div class=\"step-content\">\n                        <h4>Pay the fees</h4>\n                        <p>Usually via bank transfer by a specific deadline.</p>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"alert-box info mt-4\">\n                <strong>Crucial Note:</strong> Registering for a preparation course is NOT a registration for the exam itself. Exams require separate registration.\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Integration Course & 2026 Update -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.42 4.58a5.4 5.4 0 0 0-7.65 0l-.77.78-.77-.78a5.4 5.4 0 0 0-7.65 0C1.46 6.7 1.33 10.28 4 13l8 8 8-8c2.67-2.72 2.54-6.3.42-8.42z\"></path></svg>\n                </span>\n                The Integration Course (Funded Path)\n            </h2>\n            <p>The course includes 700 hours (600 for language up to B1, 100 for orientation regarding German culture and law).</p>\n            <ul class=\"standard-list\">\n                <li><strong>Costs:</strong> 2.29 EUR per hour (~1,600 EUR total). If receiving government benefits, it is usually <strong>100% free</strong> (BAMF covers it).</li>\n                <li><strong>Refunds:</strong> If you pass within 2 years, you can claim back 50% of your paid fees.</li>\n                <li><strong>Exemption applications:</strong> Must be submitted *before* starting. Retroactive exemptions are highly restricted.</li>\n            </ul>\n\n            <div class=\"alert-box critical mt-4\">\n                <h4 class=\"alert-heading\">⚠️ CRITICAL UPDATE: 2026 Status for Ukrainian Refugees</h4>\n                <p>The situation changed twice this year. Always verify the current status.</p>\n                <p>In February 2026, BAMF paused voluntary participation approvals under Section 44(4). However, <strong>as of August 1, 2026</strong>, a new government directive reinstates voluntary integration course access for Ukrainian war refugees and others with labor market prospects.</p>\n                <p><strong>Action:</strong> If you were rejected earlier this year, try again! Contact the Jobcenter or BAMF immediately.</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- FAQ -->\n        <div class=\"guide-block mb-5\">\n            <h2 class=\"block-title\">\n                <span class=\"icon-wrapper\">\n                    <svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M9.09 9a3 3 0 0 1 5.83 1c0 2-3 3-3 3\"></path><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"17\" x2=\"12.01\" y2=\"17\"></line></svg>\n                </span>\n                Frequently Asked Questions\n            </h2>\n            <div class=\"faq-grid mt-4\">\n                <div class=\"faq-card\">\n                    <h4>How long does it take to reach B1?</h4>\n                    <p>A full integration course takes about 6 to 12 months. Intensive study outside class accelerates this.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-card\">\n                    <h4>I failed. What now?</h4>\n                    <p>For Goethe (B1+), you only retake the failed module. For DTZ via integration courses, you usually get one free retake.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-card\">\n                    <h4>Is my 2023 certificate still valid?</h4>\n                    <p>Generally, language certificates do not expire, but some citizenship offices prefer certificates under 5-10 years old. Check locally.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-card\">\n                    <h4>Can I take the exam online?</h4>\n                    <p>No. Standardized exams (Goethe, telc, DTZ) must be taken in person at a certified center. Purely commercial online tests are usually not accepted.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-card\">\n                    <h4>Are there alternatives to the exam?</h4>\n                    <p>Yes. Completing a German school (Hauptschule minimum) or a recognized vocational training (Ausbildung) in Germany replaces the B1 requirement.</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"faq-card\">\n                    <h4>Is there childcare during the course?</h4>\n                    <p>Yes, the \"Integration Course with Child Plus\" program runs until the end of 2026, offering free childcare. Search via BAMF-NAvI.</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Footer / Support & Action Buttons -->\n        <div class=\"support-box mt-5\">\n            <h4>How We Can Help and Official Sources</h4>\n            <p>We can assist with understanding BAMF/Jobcenter letters, locating test centers, and navigating the registration process. However, we cannot influence exam results or BAMF decisions.</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"sources-links mt-4\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.bamf.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-link-btn\">BAMF Portal ↗</a>\n                <a href=\"https://bamf-navi.bamf.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-link-btn\">BAMF-NAvI Locator ↗</a>\n                <a href=\"https://germany4ukraine.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-link-btn\">Germany4Ukraine ↗</a>\n                <a href=\"https://www.goethe.de\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-link-btn\">Goethe-Institut ↗</a>\n                <a href=\"https://www.telc.net\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" class=\"source-link-btn\">telc Exams ↗</a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "slider05-22",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqj4TmrZ2m",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": false,
          "_once": false,
          "_params": {}
        },
        {
          "alias": false,
          "_styles": {
            "& when not (@fullScreen)": {
              "padding-top": "(@paddingTop * 1rem)",
              "padding-bottom": "(@paddingBottom * 1rem)"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'color')": {
              "background-color": "@bg-value"
            },
            "& when (@bg-type = 'image')": {
              "background-image": "url(@bg-value)"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image.disabled": {
              "display": "none"
            },
            ".mbr-fallback-image": {
              "display": "block",
              "background-size": "cover",
              "background-position": "center center",
              "width": "100%",
              "height": "100%",
              "position": "absolute",
              "top": "0",
              "& when (@bg-type = 'video')": {
                "background-image": "url(@fallBackImage)"
              }
            },
            "& when (@fullWidth)": {
              ".container-fluid": {
                "padding": "0 56px",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "padding": "0 22px"
                }
              }
            },
            ".container": {
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "padding": "0 22px"
              }
            },
            ".row": {
              "justify-content": "space-between"
            },
            ".logo-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "1.5rem",
              "img": {
                "width": "(@logoWidth * 1px)",
                "max-width": "100%",
                "height": "auto",
                "object-fit": "contain"
              }
            },
            ".content-wrapper": {
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              ".mbr-section-title": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              },
              ".mbr-text": {
                "margin-bottom": "32px"
              }
            },
            ".lists-wrapper": {
              "display": "grid",
              "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr 1fr",
              "gap": "1rem",
              "margin-bottom": "32px",
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr 1fr 1fr"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 768px)": {
                "grid-template-columns": "1fr"
              },
              ".list-wrap": {
                ".list": {
                  "padding": "0",
                  "margin": "0",
                  "list-style-type": "none",
                  ".item-wrap": {
                    "margin-bottom": "8px",
                    "cursor": "pointer",
                    "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    },
                    "&:last-child": {
                      "margin-bottom": "0"
                    },
                    "&:hover, &:focus": {
                      "color": "@activeList"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            },
            ".copy-wrapper": {
              "display": "flex",
              "justify-content": "space-between",
              "& when (@showBorder)": {
                "border-top": "1px solid @border",
                "padding-top": "16px"
              },
              "& when not (@showSocial)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "& when not (@showCopy)": {
                "justify-content": "center"
              },
              "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                "display": "block"
              },
              ".social-wrapper": {
                "width": "50%",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%",
                  "margin-bottom": "16px"
                },
                ".social-wrap": {
                  "display": "inline-flex",
                  "flex-wrap": "wrap",
                  ".soc-item": {
                    "margin-left": "32px",
                    "&:first-child": {
                      "margin-left": "0"
                    },
                    "a": {
                      "display": "block",
                      "&:hover, &:focus": {
                        ".mbr-iconfont": {
                          "color": "@active"
                        }
                      },
                      ".mbr-iconfont": {
                        "font-size": "16px",
                        "color": "@socColor",
                        "transition": "all 0.3s ease-in-out"
                      }
                    }
                  }
                }
              },
              ".mbr-copy": {
                "width": "50%",
                "margin-bottom": "0",
                "@media (max-width: 992px)": {
                  "width": "100%"
                }
              }
            },
            ".mbr-section-title": {
              "color": "#ff5753"
            },
            ".mbr-text": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".list": {
              "color": "#635d60"
            },
            ".mbr-copy": {
              "color": "#ffffff",
              "text-align": "right"
            },
            ".list, .item-wrap": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            ".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn": {
              "color": "#ffffff"
            },
            "a[href*=\"thebwas.com\"]": {
              "text-decoration": "underline",
              "text-underline-offset": "3px"
            },
            ".soc-item a": {
              "display": "inline-flex",
              "align-items": "center",
              "justify-content": "center",
              "min-width": "44px",
              "min-height": "44px"
            },
            ".item-wrap a": {
              "word-break": "normal !important",
              "overflow-wrap": "normal !important",
              "hyphens": "auto",
              "-webkit-hyphens": "auto"
            },
            "@media (max-width: 767px)": {
              ".lists-wrapper": {
                "display": "grid !important",
                "grid-template-columns": "minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 1fr)",
                "column-gap": "16px"
              },
              ".lists-wrapper .list-wrap": {
                "width": "auto !important",
                "max-width": "none !important",
                "margin": "0 !important"
              },
              ".lists-wrapper .item-wrap a": {
                "overflow-wrap": "break-word !important"
              }
            }
          },
          "_name": "footer01",
          "_sourceTheme": "scalem5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"footer01 scalem5\" group=\"Footer\" global once=\"footers\" mbr-class=\"{\n    'mbr-fullscreen': fullScreen,\n    'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Screen\" name=\"fullScreen\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"12\" step=\"1\" value=\"6\" condition=\"fullScreen == false\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Reverse\" name=\"reverseContent\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Logo\" name=\"showLogo\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Logo Width\" name=\"logoWidth\" min=\"50\" max=\"400\" step=\"10\" value=\"150\" condition=\"showLogo\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Lists\" name=\"showLists\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Amount\" name=\"list\" min=\"1\" max=\"5\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\" condition=\"showLists\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"List Active Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"activeList\" condition=\"showLists\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Social\" name=\"showSocial\" checked>\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Social Amount\" name=\"soc\" min=\"1\" max=\"4\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\" condition=\"showSocial\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" name=\"socColor\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Social Active Color\" value=\"#FF5753\" name=\"active\" condition=\"showSocial\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Border\" name=\"showBorder\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Border Color\" value=\"#635d60\" name=\"border\" condition=\"showBorder\" selected>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Copyright\" name=\"showCopy\" checked>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#0c2c68\" selected>\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#292325\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.2\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\" opacity=\"{{overlayOpacity}}\" bg-color=\"{{overlayColor}}\"></div>\n\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n            \n            <!-- עמודת טקסט וכותרת ראשית -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle || showText || showButtons || showLogo\">\n                <div class=\"content-wrapper\">\n                    <!-- תוספת המקום ללוגו -->\n                    <div class=\"logo-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showLogo\">\n                        <a href=\"index.html\">\n                            <img src=\"@PROJECT_PATH@/assets/images/gemini-generated-image-3uwvbn3uwvbn3uwv.png-171x171.png\" alt=\"ZusammenLeben\" width=\"171\" height=\"171\">\n                        </a>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <h4 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title, .mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\"><b>\n                        ZUSAMMENLEBEN\n                    </b></h4>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-if=\"showText\">\n                        Supporting integration, housing, and community connection for newcomers and locals in the area.\n                    </p>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\"><a class=\"btn btn-white-outline\" href=\"Contact.html\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">\n                            <span class=\"mobi-mbri mobi-mbri-phone mbr-iconfont mbr-iconfont-btn\"></span>\n                            Contact Us\n                        </a></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- עמודות הקישורים -->\n            <div class=\"col-12 col-lg-7\" mbr-if=\"showLists\">\n                <div class=\"lists-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Home</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"family-stories.html\" class=\"text-white\">Family Stories</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"services.html\" class=\"text-white\">Services</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"request-assistance.html\" class=\"text-white\">Request Assistance</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"community.html\" class=\"text-white\">Community</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 1\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"living-in-germany.html\" class=\"text-white\">Living in Germany</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"glossary.html\" class=\"text-white\">Glossary</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"learning-german.html\" class=\"text-white\">Learning German</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"refugee-rights.html\" class=\"text-white\">Refugee Rights</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"guides.html\" class=\"text-white\">Guides</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"anna-shishoili.html\" class=\"text-white text-primary\">Anna Cheishvili</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 2\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"how-to-help.html\" class=\"text-white\">How Can You Help</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"social-activity.html\" class=\"text-white\">Social Activity</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"faq.html\" class=\"text-white\">FAQ</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Areas We Serve</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 3\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"emergency.html\" class=\"text-white\">Emergency</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"Contact.html\" class=\"text-white\">Contact</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" class=\"text-white\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">WhatsApp Support</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"areasweserve.html\" class=\"text-white\">Location</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"impressum.html\" class=\"text-white\">Legal Notice</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"privacy.html\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"usingtheweb.html\" class=\"text-white\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"list-wrap\" mbr-if=\"list > 4\">\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list, .item-wrap\" data-multiline mbr-article>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Privacy Policy</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Terms of Use</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"#\" class=\"text-white\">Impressum</a></li>\n                            <li class=\"item-wrap\"><a href=\"index.html\" class=\"text-white\">Official Site</a></li>\n                        </ul>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- אזור זכויות יוצרים ורשתות חברתיות -->\n            <div class=\"col-12\" mbr-if=\"showSocial || showCopy\">\n                <div class=\"copy-wrapper\" mbr-class=\"{'flex-row-reverse' : reverseContent}\">\n                    <div class=\"social-wrapper\" mbr-if=\"showSocial\">\n                        <div class=\"social-wrap\">\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\">\n                                <a href=\"https://wa.me/380637004615\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" aria-label=\"WhatsApp\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-whatsapp\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 1\">\n                                <a href=\"mailto:zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\" aria-label=\"E-Mail\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont mobi-mbri-letter mobi-mbri\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 2\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-telegram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                            <div class=\"soc-item\" mbr-if=\"soc > 3\">\n                                <a href=\"#\">\n                                    <span mbr-icon class=\"mbr-iconfont socicon socicon-instagram\"></span>\n                                </a>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                    <p class=\"mbr-copy mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-copy, .social-wrapper\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" mbr-if=\"showCopy\">\n                        © Copyright 2026 Zusammenleben - All Rights Reserved · Website by <a href=\"https://thebwas.com/\" class=\"text-white\">Amit Shechter</a>\n                    </p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
          "_JSplaceholders": [],
          "_PHPplaceholders": [],
          "_anchor": "footer01-2b",
          "_isUserblock": true,
          "_cid": "vqpoIpWKp1",
          "_protectedParams": [],
          "_global": true,
          "_once": "footers",
          "_params": {}
        }
      ]
