          "_name": "article08",
          "_sourceTheme": "startm5",
          "_customHTML": "<section class=\"zl-page\">\n<div class=\"zl-wrap\">\n<nav class=\"zl-crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><ol><li><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a></li><li aria-current=\"page\">Privacy Policy</li></ol></nav>\n<h1>Privacy Policy</h1>\n<div class=\"zl-card zl-body\"><p>This policy explains which personal data is processed when you use zusammenleben-ukraine.de and contact us, and what rights you have under the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR).</p>\n<h2>1. Who is responsible</h2>\n<p>ZusammenLeben, Ben Shamir, Alte Hofer Str. 1, 95176 Konradsreuth, Germany. Email: <a href=\"mailto:zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\">zusammenleben.de@gmail.com</a>. Phone: <a href=\"tel:+380637004615\">+380 63 700 4615</a>.</p>\n<h2>2. Hosting and server logs</h2>\n<p>This website is a static site hosted by GitHub Pages (GitHub Inc., USA). When you open a page, the host processes technical data such as your IP address, date and time, the page requested and your browser type, in order to deliver the website securely (Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR). We do not use these logs to identify you.</p>\n<h2>3. Contact form</h2>\n<p>If you use a contact form, the data you enter (name, phone, email, message) is sent through the form service of Mobirise (mobirise.eu) to our email inbox and used only to answer your request (Art. 6(1)(b) and (f) GDPR). We delete it when it is no longer needed for your request.</p>\n<h2>4. WhatsApp, email and phone</h2>\n<p>If you write to us on WhatsApp, the service is provided by WhatsApp Ireland Ltd. (Meta). Please share sensitive documents only if necessary. Messages, emails and calls are used only to help you and are not passed on without your consent, except where required by law.</p>\n<h2>5. Fonts and images from third parties</h2>\n<p>The website loads the font \"Inter Tight\" from Google Fonts (Google Ireland Ltd.) and small flag icons from flagcdn.com. When these files load, your IP address is transmitted to these providers. We have no influence on their processing.</p>\n<h2>6. Cookies and analytics</h2>\n<p>We do not use analytics or advertising cookies. Your browser may store technical settings, for example whether the chat window was closed.</p>\n<h2>7. Your rights</h2>\n<p>You have the right to access, rectification, erasure, restriction of processing, data portability and objection. Write to <a href=\"mailto:zusammenleben.de@gmail.com\">zusammenleben.de@gmail.com</a>. You also have the right to lodge a complaint with a supervisory authority, for example the Bavarian State Office for Data Protection Supervision (BayLDA).</p>\n<p><em>Last updated: October 2026.</em></p></div>\n</div>\n</section>",
          "_cid": "zlc26f085c",
